{% comment %}
  Footer layout corrections (P28 fix-3).
  Rendered from layout/theme.liquid.

  1. base.css applies `summary { padding-block: var(--padding-sm) }` globally, which
     pushes the `menu` block headings ("Shop", "Explore") 11.2px lower than the
     `text` block headings ("Brands", "Join our email list"). On desktop the footer
     accordion is disabled (`data-disable-on-desktop`), so the summary needs no tap
     padding there and we remove it to put all four headings on one baseline.
     Mobile is untouched — the accordion tap target stays.

  2. The footer grid uses equal `1fr` tracks, so short columns leave large ragged
     gaps. `auto` tracks + `space-between` size each track to its content and spread
     the leftover space evenly between the columns.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .section > .footer-content {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, auto);
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    /* fix-3: base.css puts padding-block on every <summary>, which drops the two
       menu-block headings 11.2px below the text-block headings. */
    .footer-content .menu__heading {
      padding-block: 0;
    }

    /* Defect 1: blocks/menu.liquid forces .menu { width: 100% }, splitting the two
       manufacturer sub-columns 50/50 and wrapping "Chicago Gaming Company".
       Sizing them to content costs no extra width (192.1 + 16 + 167.7 = 375.8). */
    .footer-content .layout-panel-flex--row > .menu {
      width: auto;
    }

    /* Defects 2 + 3: push the logo to the bottom of column 4 (the grid has already
       stretched the column to the tallest column's height) and centre it horizontally.
       The `> *:last-child >` step restricts this to column 4 — see the note below. */
    .footer-content > *:last-child > .group-block-content > .group-block:last-child {
      margin-block-start: auto;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }

  /* Defect 4: the integrated button inherits the primary-button radius (14px) inside a
     100px pill field. --border-radius on the button already carries the field's radius. */
  .footer-content .email-signup__button--integrated {
    border-radius: var(--border-radius);
  }

  /* Defects 5 + 6: centre the stacked footer and separate the form from the logo.
     Every declaration sets the real property, not the inline custom property. */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .footer-content {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-content .text-block {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-content .layout-panel-flex--column {
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-content .layout-panel-flex--row {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .footer-content .menu__heading {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .footer-content > *:last-child > .group-block-content > .group-block:last-child {
      margin-block-start: var(--margin-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
